OL,3,ASeoul warns 'further action' if Ukraine
OL,4,Adoes not apologise over prisoner-of-war
OL,5,Arow
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth Korea's President Lee Jae Myung
OL,8,Fhas threatened to take unspecified
OL,9,F"further action" if Ukraine does not
OL,10,Fissue a public apology for revealing
OL,11,Fthat two North Korean prisoners of war
OL,12,Fhad been sent to the South.
OL,14,FUkraine's leader Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,15,Fmade the disclosure to the UN general
OL,16,Fassembly last week, angering Seoul, who
OL,17,Fsaid the move was meant to stay secret.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
